1
00:00:00,389 --> 00:00:03,029
(Sheldon:)...eleven.

2
00:00:04,459 --> 00:00:07,899
(Sheldon:)It's a good thing
I didn't send that letter.

3
00:00:10,766 --> 00:00:12,836
(Skype ringtone plays)

4
00:00:14,002 --> 00:00:16,602
(Raj:)Mm. Hello, Daddy. What's up?

5
00:00:16,606 --> 00:00:18,906
(Dr Koothrapalli:)Not much, just wanted to see
how my son's doing.

6
00:00:18,908 --> 00:00:20,908
(Raj:)Very well, thank you.

7
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:23,010
(Dr Koothrapalli:)Are you still dating
that dermatologist?

8
00:00:23,012 --> 00:00:25,742
(Raj:)If you could feel
how soft my skin is,

9
00:00:25,748 --> 00:00:28,448
(Raj:)you wouldn't have to ask.

10
00:00:28,451 --> 00:00:31,581
(Dr Koothrapalli:)Oh, and there's something else
I wanted to ask you.

11
00:00:31,587 --> 00:00:35,787
(Dr Koothrapalli:)Why did you spend a month's rent
on a toy helicopter?!

12
00:00:35,792 --> 00:00:39,592
(Raj:)Oh, you're where that bill goes.

13
00:00:39,595 --> 00:00:42,765
(Dr Koothrapalli:)I'm tired of indulging
your foolish lifestyle.

14
00:00:42,765 --> 00:00:44,265
(Dr Koothrapalli:)It's time you learned
responsibility.

15
00:00:44,267 --> 00:00:45,937
(Dr Koothrapalli:)And the only way
to teach you that

16
00:00:45,935 --> 00:00:47,265
(Dr Koothrapalli:)is to cut off your allowance.

17
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:49,100
No, Daddy, no!

18
00:00:49,105 --> 00:00:51,335
(Raj:)There are lots of other ways
to teach me responsibility.

19
00:00:51,341 --> 00:00:53,011
(Raj:)I know, you can give me an egg

20
00:00:53,009 --> 00:00:55,779
(Raj:)and make me take care of it
for a week!

21
00:00:55,778 --> 00:00:57,978
(Dr Koothrapalli:)No, my mind is made up.

22
00:00:57,980 --> 00:00:59,380
(Dr Koothrapalli:)Starting now,
you're on your own.

